# 白名單式：預設全部忽略，只開放明確列出的路徑（見 docs/PRD.md §9.2）
*
!*/

!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!README.md
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!astro.config.*
!tsconfig.json

!docs/**
!content/**
!scripts/**
!site/**
!public/**
!src/**
!Content-Factory/**
!.github/**

# 即使在白名單路徑內，也不允許原始素材與機密
*.pdf
*.indd
*.idml
*.indb
*.xlsx
*.ai
*.psd
*.env
.env*
*.pem
*.key
*service-account*.json
node_modules/
dist/
.astro/
__pycache__/
*.map
